{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10017_01_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:ca0aeea9eeb1790a630774ee954c59d68206b50904422607475782d4b87ab902",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c6190d9c8853f974190394f890db6e00c88a6d745ca6a294d656ad36a60c7c9",
      "text": "辛苦各位了！\n大家收到了新工作的邀约哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d9ff8f1407b3228c46da65ff1c2f294c925a620cb38650d2f33c33f28f9114c",
      "text": "我们4个……？感觉是挺罕见的阵容啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab784eef36c3d2f9deddd1d05d5fe812823328bcc9fb35bf17bf1471d4fd13f3",
      "text": "●●●●●●●●●●P酱，是什么样的工作呀？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7c15d6a18baf4d0ef6b21eb8beb6c2987a06d15bcb40cd2e18ffeba983face6",
      "text": "是关于马上就要到来的情人节的\n工作。我现在把资料发给大家。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_b:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9da6ac00989d50b4180acd05ed0d7a1944adcd91f73942a189a1ddea8db7107c",
      "text": "情人节限定的广告出演……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_b:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d615123feaa8999b258e2d6440e30958acbbc81c07c9ceb6776571e0f19c958a",
      "text": "这个，是微电影风格的啊。\n而且……还要负责演唱主题曲吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_b:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fed171901924028dc2ab1ad09f8494ba009d891004770bd5febfbf5f3815408d",
      "text": "是的！这份就是歌曲的资料。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_b:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7825dabc8da2044a6b093d73e665fe60cec82a4149bacdd0f11f72f1dbad1161",
      "text": "听说是一首从女性视角描绘的、\n令人心焦的单相思之歌哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_b:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:337a693ada7dbe585df72f7aa0aa40a7e334c8c658019a3aa80a77e528776a91",
      "text": "真的呢……停留在单相思的状态，就结束了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_b:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b2be724eda23d904b82118b7dfeaded5bd54d4f2783267f7d29ab339f61a3e2",
      "text": "这份恋情的结果，不知道吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_b:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04188aa1f9a6fa4276fb5e2cf1bf73ac89b4b7672f4faa4b7a2635ac3dd9a3da",
      "text": "负责人说：“在白色情人节发行的\n歌曲中，就会揭晓结果了！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_b:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa77b6416a92a7f7049893d357fbb2c144d74d4d500f3af7ec4af75c794ce984",
      "text": "那就是说，在听到那首歌之前，\n我们和客人的小鹿乱撞都会一直持续下去呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
